## 8. Key Components Deep Dive

### 8.1 AzureResponsesClient (`client.py`)

The client handles all LLM communication:

```python
class AzureResponsesClient:
    """
    Key Features:
    - Request chaining via previous_response_id
    - Exponential backoff with jitter
    - Global semaphore (10 concurrent calls)
    - Azure transient error detection
    - File attachment support (PDF, JSON)
    """
    
    Methods:
    - send_pdf_chunk()           # Upload PDF chunk
    - send_pdf_with_json()       # Upload PDF + JSON together
    - send_json_only()           # Upload JSON only
    - send_batch_extraction_request()  # Category extraction
    - send_continuation_request()      # Handle truncated responses
```

### 8.2 Web Matching (`web_matching.py`)

Two-stage matching approach:

```
Stage 1: SBERT Pre-filter (Local, Fast)
├── ≥ 0.92 similarity → Direct match (skip LLM)
├── 0.5 - 0.92 similarity → Candidate (send to LLM)
└── < 0.5 similarity → No match (skip LLM)

Stage 2: LLM Final Decision (Accurate, Context-aware)
├── Only receives candidates from SBERT
├── Full text provided (not just line numbers)
└── Returns strict JSON with match reasons
```

